            "start": 524,
            "end": 587,
            "quote": "`torch.version.cuda` 返回该 wheel 编译时使用的 CUDA toolkit 版本（如 `12.1`）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-20",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "e49d2d9f7b9423a804d41b487918e2065461a834f7b9b2294e77240dd65f8ff2",
            "start": 827,
            "end": 918,
            "quote": "`nvidia-smi`：右上角显示驱动所支持的 **最高** CUDA 运行时版本（`CUDA Version: 12.x`），这是驱动能兼容的上限，不代表已安装该 toolkit",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-21",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "e49d2d9f7b9423a804d41b487918e2065461a834f7b9b2294e77240dd65f8ff2",
            "start": 1747,
            "end": 1794,
            "quote": "各 CUDA Toolkit 对应的精确最低驱动版本数字（如 12.1 需要 ≥ 530.x）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-22",
            "event_id": "call_00_kjzgAVWx9pKMx3Rrwon55094.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "73e0eca0d45c737fe57abb47348e2cba8b54d3ca48857058c8dd29eb3c10c373",
            "start": 1240,
            "end": 1257,
            "quote": "CUDA 12.x\n\n>= 525",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-23",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 3863,
            "end": 3971,
            "quote": "表 A 为 **CUDA major 级别**的最低价（11.x/12.x/13.x）；每个具体 toolkit 小版本（如 12.1）的精确最低驱动需查 CUDA Toolkit Release Notes 完整表",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-24",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 995,
            "end": 1129,
            "quote": "nvcc --version                 # toolkit 编译器版本（若未装 toolkit 则无输出/报错）\ncat /usr/local/cuda/version.json 2>/dev/null   # 或 version.txt（旧版）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-25",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 4354,
            "end": 4398,
            "quote": "所有命令与表格均为**内容核查**，本轮未在任何机器上实际运行，运行状态记为\"未验证\"。",
