            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 1595,
            "end": 1655,
            "quote": "### A. 驱动 ↔ CUDA toolkit（NVIDIA Minor Version Compatibility）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-27",
            "event_id": "call_00_kjzgAVWx9pKMx3Rrwon55094.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "73e0eca0d45c737fe57abb47348e2cba8b54d3ca48857058c8dd29eb3c10c373",
            "start": 904,
            "end": 967,
            "quote": "Table 1 CUDA Toolkit 11.x, 12.x, and 13.x Driver Version Ranges",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-28",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 80,
            "end": 170,
            "quote": "**PyTorch wheel 编译时绑定的 CUDA/cuDNN**：由你 pip/conda 装的那个 `torch` 包决定，和系统里 `nvcc` 显示的 CUDA 无关。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-29",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 1336,
            "end": 1397,
            "quote": "`nvidia-smi` 里的 \"CUDA Version\" **不是**已安装的 toolkit 版本，而是驱动的上限。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-30",
            "event_id": "call_00_kjzgAVWx9pKMx3Rrwon55094.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "73e0eca0d45c737fe57abb47348e2cba8b54d3ca48857058c8dd29eb3c10c373",
            "start": 492,
            "end": 699,
            "quote": "applications compiled with a CUDA Toolkit release from within a CUDA major release family can run, with limited feature-set, on systems having at least the minimum required driver version as indicated below.",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-31",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 3604,
            "end": 3650,
            "quote": "要求 `C_driver >= C_torch`（按表 A 的最低驱动），否则报错/不可用。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-32",
            "event_id": "call_00_0X09ECDBw1aoht2U2d5q5372.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "0f268c854b2948b9bfa13e70f2b189a529e4781aa995b237a8f305507e2f3b33",
            "start": 5748,
            "end": 5828,
            "quote": "The cuDNN **dynamic** build for CUDA 12.x is compatible with CUDA 12.x for all x",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-33",
            "event_id": "call_00_EQ9sA7SBfpijXFuFD5ex5654.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "e7dd0fafe162b47ea92bfc4f029e0fcfcd83cb76a4b7ce419511ee7dfacefca0",
            "start": 7173,
            "end": 7237,
            "quote": "No actual cuDNN version numbers are listed anywhere on this page",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-34",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "5204965ce7adef8eca3bad574966152bb04fbf4ee201c362aad0e0a124cb9df2",
            "start": 3736,
            "end": 3801,
            "quote": "若系统另装了 `nvcc` 的 CUDA toolkit，它只影响从源码编译，不影响已装 wheel 运行；两者不一致不等于坏掉。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-35",
            "event_id": "call_00_kjzgAVWx9pKMx3Rrwon55094.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "73e0eca0d45c737fe57abb47348e2cba8b54d3ca48857058c8dd29eb3c10c373",
            "start": 6295,
            "end": 6462,
            "quote": "libraries that support minor version compatibility can be deployed on systems with a different version of the toolkit and libraries without recompiling the application",
            "json_escaped": false
          }
